WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:07.126
Cozlin was in the portal room with Detective Borzon and a portal operator named Zark.

2
00:00:07.127 --> 00:00:09.293
She held an empty bag.

3
00:00:09.294 --> 00:00:12.743
"Are you sure you don't want help?" the detective asked.

4
00:00:12.744 --> 00:00:15.519
"Yes, Detective," Cozlin said.

5
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.782
"You're safer on Delkor."

6
00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:20.182
"Why?" the detective asked.

7
00:00:20.183 --> 00:00:23.212
"You're just collecting gold coins, right?"

8
00:00:23.213 --> 00:00:27.850
"Um, yeah." Cozlin had told everyone about the gold.

9
00:00:27.851 --> 00:00:29.978
But she hadn't mentioned the dragon.

10
00:00:29.979 --> 00:00:32.671
She didn't want the king to change his mind.

11
00:00:32.672 --> 00:00:35.312
"I'm going to an alien planet though.

12
00:00:35.313 --> 00:00:38.905
You never know what might go wrong."

13
00:00:38.906 --> 00:00:41.485
Zark pressed buttons on a computer.

14
00:00:41.486 --> 00:00:46.139
A portal opened. "The portal leads into that chamber."

15
00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.484
Cozlin nodded.

16
00:00:48.485 --> 00:00:52.813
Then she stepped through the portal and into the warm air of the chamber.

17
00:00:52.814 --> 00:00:55.506
The dragon was sleeping again.

18
00:00:55.507 --> 00:01:02.099
Cozlin scooped up some coins and carefully placed them in the bag.

19
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.556
She scooped more coins.

20
00:01:04.557 --> 00:01:06.779
The bag was soon full.

21
00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.908
She leaned back through the portal and put it down.

22
00:01:09.909 --> 00:01:13.383
"I need another bag," she whispered.

23
00:01:13.384 --> 00:01:16.099
Detective Borzon handed her an empty bag.

24
00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.279
"Why are you whispering?"

25
00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:20.942
Cozlin didn't answer.

26
00:01:20.943 --> 00:01:23.499
She took the bag and began to fill it.

27
00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.579
Snort! Cozlin froze.

28
00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:30.936
The dragon moved slightly, but it didn't wake up.

29
00:01:30.937 --> 00:01:34.488
Cozlin finished filling the bag and returned to the portal.

30
00:01:34.489 --> 00:01:36.856
The detective gave her another bag.

31
00:01:36.857 --> 00:01:40.848
"I heard a sound. Is something in there with you?"

32
00:01:40.849 --> 00:01:43.501
"What? No!" Cozlin whispered.

33
00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:50.619
"I, um, sneezed." She pretended to sneeze. "Ah-choo! See?"

34
00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:53.833
Zark looked over. "Why are you whispering?"

35
00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:56.660
"No reason!" Cozlin hurried away.

36
00:01:56.661 --> 00:01:59.081
She filled one bag after another.

37
00:01:59.082 --> 00:02:03.120
Soon a huge pile of bags stood in the portal room.

38
00:02:03.121 --> 00:02:05.177
"That's enough," Zark said.

39
00:02:05.178 --> 00:02:07.039
"We're running out of space."

40
00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:13.324
"One more bag." Cozlin grabbed an empty bag and hurried away.

41
00:02:13.325 --> 00:02:15.849
Soon that bag was almost full.

42
00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:18.999
Cozlin grabbed one last handful of coins.

43
00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.761
Sweat dripped from her brow.

44
00:02:20.762 --> 00:02:22.405
She reached up to wipe it.

45
00:02:22.406 --> 00:02:25.898
A coin slipped from her hand and bounced off her foot.

46
00:02:25.899 --> 00:02:30.468
Cozlin watched in horror as it rolled toward the dragon's head!

47
00:02:30.469 --> 00:02:32.459
She held her breath.

48
00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.979
Luckily the coin slowed down before it reached the dragon.

49
00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:39.661
"Whew!" Cozlin let out a sigh of relief.

50
00:02:39.662 --> 00:02:41.870
But then the coin began to spin.

51
00:02:41.871 --> 00:02:44.962
The spinning sound grew faster—and louder.

52
00:02:44.963 --> 00:02:47.366
It echoed off the chamber's walls.

53
00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:51.044
"No!" Cozlin thought, biting her lip.

54
00:02:51.045 --> 00:02:53.315
Finally the coin lay still.

55
00:02:53.316 --> 00:02:55.405
The dragon was still asleep.

56
00:02:55.406 --> 00:03:01.729
Cozlin relaxed, and the rest of the coins slipped from her hand. Crash!

57
00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:04.475
The dragon's eyes shot open.

58
00:03:04.476 --> 00:03:07.638
It stood up and spotted Cozlin.

59
00:03:07.639 --> 00:03:10.803
Cozlin gulped.

60
00:03:10.804 --> 00:03:13.874
Flames shot from the dragon's mouth.

61
00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:17.649
She ducked out of the way and flew toward the portal.

62
00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:20.924
Whump! The dragon landed in front of her.

63
00:03:20.925 --> 00:03:24.021
Cozlin turned fast to avoid another blast of fire.

64
00:03:24.022 --> 00:03:27.321
The dragon swung its tail. Wham!

65
00:03:27.322 --> 00:03:32.615
It sent Cozlin tumbling across the floor.

66
00:03:32.616 --> 00:03:36.866
"Grr!" Cozlin held up her hand. Zap!

67
00:03:36.867 --> 00:03:39.366
Her laser hit the dragon's nose.

68
00:03:39.367 --> 00:03:42.660
Roar! The chamber shook.

69
00:03:42.661 --> 00:03:45.936
Bits of rock fell from above.

70
00:03:45.937 --> 00:03:50.441
The dragon leaped, its sharp claws sparkling in the torchlight.

71
00:03:50.442 --> 00:03:56.399
Cozlin zipped under the dragon and flew through the portal.

72
00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:59.147
"Kid Comet!" Detective Borzon said.

73
00:03:59.148 --> 00:04:03.652
"What was all that . . ." His eyes went wide.

74
00:04:03.653 --> 00:04:05.821
Cozlin spun around.

75
00:04:05.822 --> 00:04:10.282
The dragon's head was poking through the portal!

